OL,3,AResidents warned not to drink tap water
OL,4,Aafter hundreds fall sick near South
OL,5,AAfrica capital
OL,6,
OL,7,FTshwane has faced numerous outbreaks
OL,8,Ffrom waterborne diseases in recent
OL,9,Fyears. In 2023, 29 people were killed
OL,10,Fby a cholera outbreak in a township
OL,11,Fjust outside Pretoria.
